/target/

# Installed by bun.
node_modules/

# The browser bundle, built from Web/ by bun and embedded by the crate. It is a
# build artefact: it ships inside the published crate, built at release, rather
# than being kept in step with its sources by hand here. A checkout without it
# builds against assets/placeholder.html; see build.rs.
/assets/index.html

